{
  "id": "canva-all-projects",
  "title": "All Projects",
  "description": "Tile: All Projects - Canva. LIVE DATA. Originally built and verified in tile-harness as 'Folder Contents' (folder_id: 'root', all 4 item types via list_folder_items), promoted here after the user approved it and asked for a dedicated feature branch/PR. Shows a flat listing of whatever sits at the top level of the connected account's Projects (Canva's own 'root' folder id, confirmed live -- no per-tenant folder ID needed, unlike canva-content-pipeline's hardcoded-folder approach). Three category tabs mirror Canva's own Projects sidebar (Recent / Folders / Design), all client-side filters over the SAME single fetch -- no extra MCP call. A bucket-bar chart sits above the tabs (Recent/Folders/Design counts, matching Content Pipeline's own bucket-bar visual pattern) -- always computed from the FULL raw item list regardless of which tab is active, using chart-1/chart-2/chart-3 tones since this is a non-status categorical breakdown per TILE-DISPLAY-STANDARDS.md §7, not a progression/urgency field. BUG FOUND AND FIXED DURING BUILD (caught by the user comparing this tile side-by-side against a real canva.com/projects screenshot): 'Recent' originally returned the FULL unfiltered root listing, including the 'Uploads' folder -- wrong, since Canva's own Recents section never lists folders, only content. Fixed: 'recent' now excludes type==='folder' explicitly, confirmed live to match Canva's real Recents exactly (same design titles, no folder). REMAINING DISCLOSED APPROXIMATION: 'Recent' here is still this one root folder's own content, already modified_descending, not Canva's real cross-folder recent-activity view -- this tile has one dataProvider call and can't also fire the separate, site-wide list_designs call that would be needed for a literal match (see canva_folder_item_* / canva_filter_items_by_tab doc comments in this plugin's widget-elements/src/index.ts for the full reasoning). 'Folders' and 'Design' tabs ARE exact, live, zero-extra-call matches (type==='folder' / type==='design'). Two disclosed limitations: (1) design/folder nested-object field names (title/name, updated_at) are confirmed live; image/brand_template are NOT -- no live examples were available to inspect. (2) Only design rows are individually clickable -- get_folder was checked LIVE and returns no URL field at all, so there is no real per-folder/per-image/per-template deep link; clicking anything else no-ops. The footer 'Open in Canva' button points at the generic https://www.canva.com/projects entry point, since 'root' IS that top-level Projects view.",
  "category": "marketing",
  "tags": ["canva", "design", "folders", "files", "browser", "tabs"],
  "keywords": ["all projects", "folder contents", "file browser", "projects", "recent", "designs", "folders", "images", "brand templates"],
  "connectorsUsed": ["canva"],
  "popularity": 0,
  "sizing": {
    "preferred": { "colSpan": 5, "rowSpan": 8 },
    "min": { "colSpan": 4, "rowSpan": 6 },
    "max": { "colSpan": 9, "rowSpan": 12 }
  },
  "dataProvider": {
    "mcp": "canva",
    "tool": "list_folder_items",
    "params": {
      "folder_id": "root",
      "item_types": ["design", "folder", "image", "brand_template"],
      "sort_by": "modified_descending",
      "limit": 20
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "root": "card",
    "elements": {
      "card": {
        "type": "Card",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["header", "categoryBucketStack", "tabRow", "body", "footerDivider", "footer"],
        "watch": {
          "/canva/list_folder_items/items": [
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": { "statePath": "/ui/activeTab", "value": "recent" }
            },
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/filteredItems",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "canva_filter_items_by_tab",
                  "args": {
                    "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" },
                    "tab": "recent"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "/ui/activeTab": [
            {
              "action": "setState",
              "params": {
                "statePath": "/ui/filteredItems",
                "value": {
                  "$computed": "canva_filter_items_by_tab",
                  "args": {
                    "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" },
                    "tab": { "$state": "/ui/activeTab" }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },

      "header": {
        "type": "Header",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["headerRow"]
      },
      "headerRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start", "justify": "between" },
        "children": ["titleGroup", "countBadge"]
      },
      "titleGroup": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "start" },
        "children": ["titleIcon", "titleStack"]
      },
      "titleIcon": {
        "type": "Icon",
        "props": { "name": "FolderOpen", "tone": "accent", "size": "sm" }
      },
      "titleStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none" },
        "children": ["title", "subtitle"]
      },
      "title": {
        "type": "Heading",
        "props": { "text": "All Projects", "level": "h2" }
      },
      "subtitle": {
        "type": "Eyebrow",
        "props": { "text": "Canva · Your Projects (live)" }
      },
      "countBadge": {
        "type": "Badge",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "fmt",
            "args": {
              "pattern": "{n} items",
              "n": {
                "$computed": "count",
                "args": { "value": { "$state": "/ui/filteredItems" } }
              }
            }
          },
          "tone": "muted",
          "variant": "soft"
        },
        "visible": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0" }
      },

      "categoryBucketStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "xs" },
        "children": ["bucketRecent", "bucketFolders", "bucketDesign"],
        "visible": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0" }
      },

      "bucketRecent": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketRecentRow", "bucketRecentBarRow"] },
      "bucketRecentRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketRecentLabel", "bucketRecentVal"] },
      "bucketRecentLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "Recent", "size": "sm" } },
      "bucketRecentVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_category_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "tab": "recent" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketRecentBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketRecentBar"] },
      "bucketRecentBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_category_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "tab": "recent" } },
          "tone": "chart-1"
        }
      },

      "bucketFolders": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketFoldersRow", "bucketFoldersBarRow"] },
      "bucketFoldersRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketFoldersLabel", "bucketFoldersVal"] },
      "bucketFoldersLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "Folders", "size": "sm" } },
      "bucketFoldersVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_category_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "tab": "folders" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketFoldersBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketFoldersBar"] },
      "bucketFoldersBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_category_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "tab": "folders" } },
          "tone": "chart-3"
        }
      },

      "bucketDesign": { "type": "Stack", "props": { "gap": "xs" }, "children": ["bucketDesignRow", "bucketDesignBarRow"] },
      "bucketDesignRow": { "type": "Row", "props": { "justify": "between" }, "children": ["bucketDesignLabel", "bucketDesignVal"] },
      "bucketDesignLabel": { "type": "Text", "props": { "text": "Design", "size": "sm" } },
      "bucketDesignVal": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_category_count", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "tab": "design" } },
          "size": "sm", "weight": "medium"
        }
      },
      "bucketDesignBarRow": { "type": "Row", "props": {}, "children": ["bucketDesignBar"] },
      "bucketDesignBar": {
        "type": "ProgressBar",
        "props": {
          "value": { "$computed": "canva_category_pct", "args": { "items": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items" }, "tab": "design" } },
          "tone": "chart-2"
        }
      },

      "tabRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "xs", "align": "center" },
        "children": ["tabRecentBtn", "tabFoldersBtn", "tabDesignBtn"],
        "visible": { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0" }
      },
      "tabRecentBtn": {
        "type": "Button",
        "props": {
          "label": "Recent",
          "variant": { "$computed": "canva_tab_button_variant", "args": { "active": { "$state": "/ui/activeTab" }, "tab": "recent" } },
          "size": "sm",
          "ariaLabel": "Show recent items"
        },
        "on": {
          "click": { "action": "setState", "params": { "statePath": "/ui/activeTab", "value": "recent" } }
        }
      },
      "tabFoldersBtn": {
        "type": "Button",
        "props": {
          "label": "Folders",
          "variant": { "$computed": "canva_tab_button_variant", "args": { "active": { "$state": "/ui/activeTab" }, "tab": "folders" } },
          "size": "sm",
          "ariaLabel": "Show folders only"
        },
        "on": {
          "click": { "action": "setState", "params": { "statePath": "/ui/activeTab", "value": "folders" } }
        }
      },
      "tabDesignBtn": {
        "type": "Button",
        "props": {
          "label": "Design",
          "variant": { "$computed": "canva_tab_button_variant", "args": { "active": { "$state": "/ui/activeTab" }, "tab": "design" } },
          "size": "sm",
          "ariaLabel": "Show designs only"
        },
        "on": {
          "click": { "action": "setState", "params": { "statePath": "/ui/activeTab", "value": "design" } }
        }
      },

      "body": {
        "type": "Body",
        "props": {},
        "children": ["loading", "emptyNoData", "empty", "itemList"]
      },

      "loading": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "sm" },
        "children": ["sk1", "sk2", "sk3", "sk4"],
        "visible": { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items" }
      },
      "sk1": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk2": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk3": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },
      "sk4": { "type": "Skeleton", "props": { "height": "2.5rem", "rounded": "md" } },

      "empty": {
        "type": "Empty",
        "props": {
          "message": { "$computed": "canva_tab_empty_message", "args": { "tab": { "$state": "/ui/activeTab" } } }
        },
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0" },
            { "$state": "/ui/filteredItems/0", "not": true }
          ]
        }
      },
      "emptyNoData": {
        "type": "Empty",
        "props": { "message": "This folder is empty." },
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/canva/list_folder_items/items/0", "not": true }
          ]
        }
      },

      "itemList": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "xs" },
        "children": ["itemRow"],
        "repeat": { "statePath": "/ui/filteredItems", "key": "design/id" },
        "limit": 20,
        "visible": {
          "$and": [
            { "$state": "/_loading/canva.list_folder_items", "not": true },
            { "$state": "/ui/filteredItems/0" }
          ]
        }
      },
      "itemRow": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "gap": "sm", "align": "center", "hover": true, "clickable": true },
        "children": ["itemIcon", "itemStack", "itemTime"],
        "on": {
          "click": {
            "action": "open_url",
            "params": {
              "url": { "$computed": "canva_folder_item_open_url", "args": { "item": { "$item": "" } } },
              "target": "_blank"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "itemIcon": {
        "type": "Icon",
        "props": {
          "name": { "$computed": "canva_folder_item_icon", "args": { "item": { "$item": "" } } },
          "tone": "muted",
          "size": "sm"
        }
      },
      "itemStack": {
        "type": "Stack",
        "props": { "gap": "none", "grow": true },
        "children": ["itemName", "itemType"]
      },
      "itemName": {
        "type": "Text",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_folder_item_name", "args": { "item": { "$item": "" } } },
          "size": "sm",
          "weight": "medium",
          "truncate": true
        }
      },
      "itemType": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": {
          "text": { "$computed": "canva_folder_item_type_label", "args": { "item": { "$item": "" } } },
          "tone": "muted"
        }
      },
      "itemTime": {
        "type": "Caption",
        "props": {
          "text": {
            "$computed": "canva_relative_time",
            "args": {
              "value": {
                "$computed": "canva_folder_item_updated_at",
                "args": { "item": { "$item": "" } }
              }
            }
          },
          "tone": "muted"
        }
      },

      "footerDivider": { "type": "Divider", "props": {} },
      "footer": {
        "type": "Row",
        "props": { "justify": "end" },
        "children": ["openCanvaBtn"]
      },
      "openCanvaBtn": {
        "type": "Button",
        "props": {
          "label": "Open in Canva",
          "leadingIcon": "ExternalLink",
          "variant": "secondary",
          "size": "sm",
          "ariaLabel": "Open your Canva Projects folder in a new tab"
        },
        "on": {
          "click": {
            "action": "open_url",
            "params": { "url": "https://www.canva.com/projects", "target": "_blank" }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "status": "draft"
}
